---
layout: layouts/page.njk
pagination:
  data: states
  size: 1
  alias: state
permalink: "/states/{{ state.slug }}/insurance/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Car Insurance in {{ state.name }} — Requirements & Best Rates"
  description: "Everything you need to know about car insurance in {{ state.name }}: minimum coverage requirements ({{ state.insuranceMinimum }}), average costs, and tips to find the cheapest rates."
  breadcrumbs:
    - label: Home
      url: /
    - label: States
      url: /states/
    - label: "{{ state.name }}"
      url: "/states/{{ state.slug }}/"
    - label: Insurance
---

<div class="prose-dark">

<h2 id="requirements">{{ state.name }} Minimum Insurance Requirements</h2>

<p>{{ state.name }} requires drivers to carry at least the following minimum liability insurance coverage: <strong>{{ state.insuranceMinimum }}</strong>.</p>

<div class="glass-card metallic-border rounded-2xl overflow-hidden carbon-panel my-8 not-prose">
  <div class="steel-header px-6 py-4">
    <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-lg">Coverage Breakdown</h3>
  </div>
  <div class="px-6 py-5">
    <p class="text-silver-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">{{ state.insuranceMinimumDetail }}</p>
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.05]">
        <div class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-silver-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Minimum Coverage</div>
        <div class="font-bold text-white text-lg mt-1">{{ state.insuranceMinimum }}</div>
      </div>
      {% if state.averageInsuranceCost %}
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.05]">
        <div class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-silver-500 uppercase tracking-wider">2024 combined average</div>
        <div class="font-bold text-white text-lg mt-1">${{ state.averageInsuranceCost | naicDollars }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% if state.averageInsuranceCost %}
<p>The statewide all-vehicle average premium in {{ state.name }} is <strong>${{ state.averageInsuranceCost | naicDollars }}</strong>.{% if state.averageInsuranceSource %} {{ state.averageInsuranceSource }}{% endif %}</p>
{% endif %}

{% if state.uninsuredPercent %}
<h2 id="uninsured">Uninsured motorists in {{ state.name }}</h2>
<p>The Insurance Research Council estimated that {{ state.uninsuredPercent }} percent of motorists in {{ state.name }} were uninsured in 2023, rank {{ state.uninsuredRank }} of 51 jurisdictions, against a countrywide 15.4 percent in the same 2025 study. The Insurance Information Institute republishes the IRC estimates in <a href="https://www.iii.org/fact-statistic/facts-statistics-uninsured-motorists" rel="noopener">Facts + Statistics: Uninsured motorists</a>.</p>
{% if state.slug == "florida" %}
<p>The IRC note for Florida says compulsory auto laws there apply to personal injury protection and property damage, not to third-party bodily injury coverage.</p>
{% endif %}
{% endif %}

<h2 id="department">{{ state.name }} insurance department</h2>
<p>Complaints, rate filings, and the current {{ state.name }} minimums are handled by the {{ state.name }} insurance department, which the NAIC lists in the <a href="https://content.naic.org/state-insurance-departments" rel="noopener">state insurance department directory</a>, so confirm {{ state.name | aan }} {{ state.name }} limit there before relying on this page.</p>

<p>The <a href="/guides/insurance/best-car-insurance/">car insurance guide</a> explains how to read a quote, and that guide is not {{ state.name | aan }} {{ state.name }} rate filing.</p>

<div class="glass-card metallic-border rounded-2xl p-8 carbon-panel text-center my-10 not-prose">
  <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Compare {{ state.name }} Insurance Rates</h3>
  <p class="text-silver-400 mb-6 max-w-lg mx-auto">See quotes from top carriers in {{ state.name }} and find the best rate for your situation. It takes less than 5 minutes.</p>
  <a href="/go/insurance/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl btn-primary text-white font-bold text-sm">
    Get Free Quotes
    <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 6H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 003 8.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0018 18.75V10.5m-10.5 6L21 3m0 0h-5.25M21 3v5.25"/></svg>
  </a>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[10px] text-silver-500/50">Affiliate link. We may earn a commission at no cost to you.</p>
</div>

</div>
